  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lhoopa Promoting Green Affordable Housing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project entails a senior revolving credit facility to Lhoopa with an initial credit limit of $5,000,000, which may be increased to $10,000,000 and $20,000,000 subject to defined performance criteria. The assistance of the Asian Development Bank (ADB) will support Lhoopa to provide affordable housing to average income earners in the Philippines and is strongly aligned with the government&apos;s goal of eliminating the country&apos;s housing backlog by 2030.</narrative>
  </description>
